        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>Migration from a multi-architecture payload to a single-architecture payload is not supported. Once a cluster has transitioned to using a multi-architecture payload, it can no longer accept a single-architecture update payload.</p>
